{
  "version": 1,
  "source": "QUIPS_LIBRARY.md (Lotty, Nov 24, 2026). Texts verbatim from the library; durationSec measured with ffprobe from the recorded, director-approved masters staged under public/audio/streak/.",
  "categories": {
    "announcer": [
